# Site Theme

Use this palette consistently across all UI:

| Role | Tailwind | Hex |
|------|----------|-----|
| Primary accent | `violet-600` | `#7c3aed` |
| Text & dark UI | `black` | `#000000` |
| Backgrounds | `white` | `#ffffff` |

## Guidelines

- **Primary actions & accents**: `bg-violet-600`, `text-violet-600`, `border-violet-600`
- **Soft accent backgrounds**: `bg-violet-600/10`, hover states `hover:bg-violet-600/10 hover:text-violet-600`
- **Focus rings**: `focus:border-violet-600 focus:ring-violet-600/20`
- **Primary text**: `text-black`; muted text `text-black/70` or `text-black/40` for placeholders
- **Borders & dividers**: `border-black/10`
- **Dark buttons** (e.g. Sign In): `bg-black text-white hover:bg-violet-600`
- **Page background**: always `bg-white`

Do not introduce other accent colors (green, blue, etc.) unless the user explicitly requests them.
